#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.jax.cutile\\_call"
msgstr "cuda.tile.jax.cutile\\_call"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:1 of
msgid "Launch a cuTile kernel from a JAX-traced graph."
msgstr "从 JAX 追踪计算图中启动 cuTile 内核。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:3 of
msgid ""
"Tuple of up to 3 grid dimensions to execute the |kernel| over. Padded "
"with 1s on the right."
msgstr "用于执行 |kernel| 的网格维度元组，最多包含 3 个维度。不足 3 维时会在右侧填充 1。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:5 of
msgid "The |kernel| to execute."
msgstr "要执行的 |kernel| 。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:6 of
msgid ""
"Positional arguments to pass to the kernel. Each entry must match the "
"kernel's corresponding parameter:  - :class:`jax.Array`: read-only input "
"buffer. - :class:`OutputPlaceholder`: output buffer with the given   "
"``shape`` and ``dtype``; allocated by JAX and returned from   this call. "
"- :class:`InputOutput`: input buffer aliased to an output slot,   "
"enabling in-place updates. - ``bool``, ``int``, or ``float``: A scalar "
"argument to the kernel.   Because JAX treats scalar as 0D Array, to pass "
"a scalar argument,   it must be a static argument of the JAX function "
"using   ``static_argnums`` or ``static_argnames``. - ``tuple``: A tuple "
"parameter (the kernel parameter is annotated   as ``tuple[...]``). Each "
"element is recursively one of the above   and tuples may be nested. "
"Elements that are runtime scalars are   subject to the same "
"``static_argnums`` requirement as top-level   scalars."
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:6 of
msgid ""
"Positional arguments to pass to the kernel. Each entry must match the "
"kernel's corresponding parameter:"
msgstr "传递给内核的位置参数。每一项都必须与内核中对应的形参相匹配："

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:9 of
msgid ":class:`jax.Array`: read-only input buffer."
msgstr ":class:`jax.Array` ：只读输入缓冲区。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:10 of
msgid ""
":class:`OutputPlaceholder`: output buffer with the given ``shape`` and "
"``dtype``; allocated by JAX and returned from this call."
msgstr ""
":class:`OutputPlaceholder` ：具有指定 ``shape`` 和 ``dtype`` 的输出缓冲区；由 JAX "
"分配并在本次调用中返回。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:13 of
msgid ""
":class:`InputOutput`: input buffer aliased to an output slot, enabling "
"in-place updates."
msgstr ":class:`InputOutput` ：别名绑定到输出槽位的输入缓冲区，用于支持原地（in-place）更新。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:15 of
msgid ""
"``bool``, ``int``, or ``float``: A scalar argument to the kernel. Because"
" JAX treats scalar as 0D Array, to pass a scalar argument, it must be a "
"static argument of the JAX function using ``static_argnums`` or "
"``static_argnames``."
msgstr ""
"``bool`` 、 ``int`` 或 ``float`` ：传递给内核的标量参数。由于 JAX 将标量视为 0 维 "
"Array，若要传递标量参数，必须通过 ``static_argnums`` 或 ``static_argnames`` 将其标记为 JAX "
"函数的静态参数。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:19 of
msgid ""
"``tuple``: A tuple parameter (the kernel parameter is annotated as "
"``tuple[...]``). Each element is recursively one of the above and tuples "
"may be nested. Elements that are runtime scalars are subject to the same "
"``static_argnums`` requirement as top-level scalars."
msgstr ""
"``tuple`` ：元组参数（内核形参需注解为 ``tuple[...]`` "
"）。每个元素递归地为上述类型之一，且元组支持嵌套。作为运行时标量的元素须遵循与顶层标量相同的 ``static_argnums`` 要求。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.jax.cutile_call.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:25 of
msgid ""
"For a kernel with one output, the output array. For multiple outputs "
"(multiple ``OutputPlaceholder`` / ``InputOutput`` args), a tuple of "
"arrays in declaration order."
msgstr ""
"对于单输出内核，返回输出数组；对于多输出内核（多个 ``OutputPlaceholder`` / ``InputOutput`` "
"参数），按声明顺序返回由数组组成的元组。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:30 of
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:31 of
msgid ""
"1. Array passed to cutile_call will use default XLA row-major order. "
"Customizing layout will be supported in the future."
msgstr "1\\. 传递给 ``cutile_call`` 的数组将使用默认的 XLA 行主序（row-major）布局。自定义布局将在后续版本中支持。"

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:34 of
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: cuda.tile.jax._jax.cutile_call:83 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

